cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Jika Anda menggunakan proyek ini dalam riset, tugas akademik, atau bahan ajar,
  mohon sitasi seperti di bawah ini dan sebutkan keterbatasan dataset sesuai
  docs/audit/timeline-canon-audit.md. / If you use this project, please cite it
  as below and mention the documented limitations in the canon audit.
title: "Tempest–Eastern Empire War Map: Campaign Atlas and Battlefield Timeline"
abstract: >-
  An interactive reconstruction of the Tempest–Eastern Empire War from the light
  novel series "Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken" (volumes 12–16): a canon-audited
  campaign of 165 events on a 75-day, ten-minute simulation clock, with territories
  traced from the supplied base map, army sizes, movements and battles. Every event
  carries a provenance class (canonical, visually reconstructed, inferred,
  reconstructed, unresolved) and source locators; unknown values stay UNKNOWN.
  Non-commercial fan project; not affiliated with the rights holders of the
  original work.
